The apport is increased any time the pet eats food that you fed it: 
usually the spoilers say to throw food to your pet to feed it, but it 
doesn't have to be thrown.  The check in the source code is whether or 
not the food the pet is eating has an inventory letter assigned (i.e., if 
it has ever been in the player's inventory).  This means you can increase 
your pets apport using food still owned by a shopkeeper!


